# CODEOWNERS — human review required for Foundation (PRODUCT_CANON C-29/C-30).
#
# Foundation is the deployment-independent machinery: schemas, state machines,
# security boundaries, providers, installers, migrations and the control plane.
# It changes only through a reviewed platform release, never from a deployment.
# Fleet Definition content (roles, soul overlays, declarative skills, processes,
# responsibilities, policies) is the *other* loop — it is authored by Prime in the
# tenant registry and does not pass through this file at all.
#
# This list previously covered three paths (.github, contracts.json, daemon/),
# leaving the brain, libs, system tooling, manifests, bootstrap scripts, skills
# and the entire dashboard unowned.

# Default owner
* chill@tachin.ai

